                        "text": "var p=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,(time-0.5)/(3.8-0.5))); p=1-Math.pow(1-p,3);var c=Math.exp(Math.log(95000000)+p*(Math.log(500)-Math.log(95000000)));function f(n){return Math.round(n).toString().replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{3})+(?!\\d))/g, \",\");}\"$\"+f(c<1000?Math.round(c/10)*10:c)",
